<title>NEW ZEALAND: Cavalier yr profit falls to NZ$10.3 mln.</title>
<headline>Cavalier yr profit falls to NZ$10.3 mln.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-08-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to June 30.</p>
<p>			   (million NZ$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit				 10.3 vs 12.4</p>
<p>    Shr (cents)				 28.5 vs 34.5</p>
<p>    Div (cents)				 12.0 vs same</p>
<p>    Total div for yr (cents)		26.0 vs same</p>
<p>    Turnover				   199.1 vs 250.1</p>
<p>    Pretax profit			    15.52 vs 18.66</p>
<p>    Tax					   5.25 vs 6.26</p>
<p>    Shares outstanding (million)	 35.99 vs same</p>
<p>Dividend carries 5.910448 cps imputation credit.</p>
<p>Pay date November 7</p>
<p>Reg date October 25</p>
<p>    Ex div   October 28</p>
<p>Note - Cavalier Corporation Ltd is involved in wool scouring and the production and marketing of wool and wool carpet.</p>
<p>--Wellington Newsroom (64 4) 4734746</p>
</text>
